* sample.a1 -- a 6801 program for as1.  The 6801 adds MUL, ADDD and the* D register to the 6800, so this uses them: as0 would reject it.*        org     $0100start   ldd     #$1234        addd    delta        std     result        ldaa    #$07        ldab    #$06        mul        std     product        swidelta   fdb     $0100result  rmb     2product rmb     2        end